<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="tr">
<head>
	<meta charset="utf-8" />
	<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
	<title>Doğanın Teknolojisi: Kanatların Matematiği & Yazılım</title>
	
	<meta name="description" content="Doğa araştırmaları, biyo-teknoloji ve arı kolonisi simülasyonları ile modern yazılım mimarilerinin buluştuğu dijital platform." />
	<meta name="robots" content="index, follow" />
	
	<style>
		:root {
			--bg-black: #0d0d0d;
			--bg-surface: #1c1c1c;
			--text-main: #e2e8f0;
			--text-muted: #94a3b8;
			--amber: #f59e0b;
			--amber-glow: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.45);
			--border-subtle: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
			--surface-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05), 0 10px 30px -10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8);
		}

		* {
			box-sizing: border-box;
			margin: 0;
			padding: 0;
		}

		html {
			scroll-behavior: smooth;
		}

		body {
			background-color: var(--bg-black);
			color: var(--text-main);
			font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
			line-height: 1.6;
		}

		.container {
			max-width: 1000px;
			margin: 0 auto;
			padding: 0 1.5rem;
		}

		/* Header */
		header {
			position: fixed;
			top: 0;
			left: 0;
			width: 100%;
			background: rgba(13, 13, 13, 0.85);
			backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
			-webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
			border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
			z-index: 1000;
		}

		.header-inner {
			display: grid;
			grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 1fr;
			align-items: center;
			height: 70px;
		}

		.header-left {
			grid-column: 1;
			display: flex;
			justify-content: flex-start;
			align-items: center;
		}

		.logo {
			grid-column: 2;
			font-size: 1.35rem;
			font-weight: 700;
			color: var(--text-main);
			text-decoration: none;
			letter-spacing: 0.5px;
			display: flex;
			align-items: center;
			gap: 0.6rem;
			justify-content: center;
		}

		.logo-icon {
			display: flex;
			align-items: center;
			justify-content: center;
			transition: transform 0.3s ease;
		}

		.logo:hover .logo-icon {
			transform: scale(1.08);
		}

		.header-right {
			grid-column: 3;
			display: flex;
			justify-content: flex-end;
			align-items: center;
		}

		.search-btn, 
		.dropdown-trigger {
			background: linear-gradient(180deg, #282828 0%, #1a1a1a 100%);
			border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
			color: var(--text-main);
			cursor: pointer;
			padding: 0.55rem;
			border-radius: 10px;
			display: flex;
			align-items: center;
			justify-content: center;
			box-shadow: 
				inset 0 1px 0 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15),
				0 4px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
			transition: all 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
		}

		.search-btn:hover, 
		.dropdown-trigger:hover,
		.dropdown.open .dropdown-trigger {
			background: linear-gradient(180deg, #323232 0%, #202020 100%);
			color: var(--amber);
			border-color: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.4);
			box-shadow: 
				inset 0 1px 0 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2),
				0 6px 14px -2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7),
				0 0 12px -2px var(--amber-glow);
			transform: translateY(-1px);
		}

		.search-btn:active, 
		.dropdown-trigger:active {
			transform: translateY(1px);
			box-shadow: 
				inset 0 2px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6),
				0 1px 2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
		}

		.search-btn svg {
			width: 22px;
			height: 22px;
			fill: none;
			stroke: currentColor;
			stroke-width: 2;
			stroke-linecap: round;
			stroke-linejoin: round;
		}

		/* Dropdown */
		.dropdown {
			position: relative;
		}

		.dropdown-menu {
			position: absolute;
			top: calc(100% + 16px);
			left: 0;
			width: 240px;
			background: #18181b;
			border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
			border-radius: 16px;
			padding: 0.75rem;
			box-shadow: 0 20px 40px -5px rgba(0,0,0,0.9), 0 8px 20px -4px rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.1);
			opacity: 0;
			visibility: hidden;
			transform: translateY(-8px);
			transition: all 0.25s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
			z-index: 1001;
		}

		.dropdown.open .dropdown-menu {
			opacity: 1;
			visibility: visible;
			transform: translateY(0);
		}

		.dropdown-item {
			display: flex;
			align-items: center;
			gap: 16px;
			color: var(--text-main);
			text-decoration: none;
			padding: 0.9rem 1rem;
			font-size: 1.05rem;
			border-radius: 10px;
			font-weight: 500;
			transition: all 0.2s ease;
		}

		.dropdown-item svg {
			width: 22px;
			height: 22px;
			stroke: #e2e8f0;
			opacity: 0.9;
		}

		.dropdown-item:hover {
			background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
		}

		.dropdown-item.astro-item {
			color: var(--amber);
		}

		.dropdown-item.astro-item svg {
			stroke: var(--amber);
			opacity: 1;
		}

		.dropdown-item.astro-item:hover {
			background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.1);
		}

		/* Search Panel */
		.search-panel {
			max-height: 0;
			overflow: hidden;
			background: var(--bg-surface);
			border-bottom: 0 solid var(--border-subtle);
			transition: max-height 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1), padding 0.3s ease;
		}

		.search-panel.active {
			max-height: 100px;
			border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
		}

		.search-panel-inner {
			padding: 1rem 0 1.5rem 0;
		}

		.search-input {
			width: 100%;
			padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
			background: var(--bg-black);
			border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
			border-radius: 8px;
			color: var(--text-main);
			font-size: 0.95rem;
			outline: none;
			box-shadow: inset 0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
			transition: border-color 0.3s ease;
		}

		.search-input:focus {
			border-color: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.5);
		}

		/* Sections */
		section {
			padding: 4rem 2rem;
			margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
			background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(28, 28, 28, 0.4) 0%, rgba(20, 20, 20, 0.6) 100%);
			border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
			border-radius: 16px;
			box-shadow: var(--surface-shadow);
		}

		h2 {
			color: var(--text-main);
			font-size: 1.75rem;
			margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
			font-weight: 700;
		}

		/* Hero */
		.hero {
			text-align: center;
			padding-top: 5rem;
			padding-bottom: 4rem;
			margin-top: 6rem;
			background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(28, 28, 28, 0.6) 0%, rgba(13, 13, 13, 0.2) 100%);
		}

		h1 {
			font-size: 2.75rem;
			line-height: 1.2;
			margin-bottom: 1rem;
			color: var(--text-main);
			font-weight: 800;
		}

		.subtitle {
			font-size: 1.25rem;
			color: var(--amber);
			font-weight: 600;
			margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
			letter-spacing: 0.3px;
		}

		.description {
			max-width: 600px;
			margin: 0 auto;
			color: var(--text-muted);
		}

		/* Grid & Cards */
		.grid {
			display: grid;
			grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
			gap: 1.75rem;
		}

		.card {
			position: relative;
			background: var(--bg-surface);
			border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
			padding: 1.75rem;
			border-radius: 12px;
			box-shadow: 0 10px 25px -5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8), 0 12px 20px -6px var(--amber-glow);
			transition: transform 0.3s ease, border-color 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
		}

		.card:hover {
			transform: translateY(-5px);
			border-color: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.4);
			box-shadow: 0 15px 35px -5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9), 0 18px 28px -4px rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.65);
		}

		.card h3 {
			color: var(--amber);
			margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
			font-weight: 700;
		}

		.card p {
			color: var(--text-muted);
			font-size: 0.95rem;
		}

		/* Stats */
		.stats-grid {
			display: grid;
			grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
			text-align: center;
			gap: 2rem;
		}

		.stat-number {
			font-size: 3rem;
			font-weight: 800;
			color: var(--text-main);
			margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
		}

		.stat-label {
			color: var(--text-muted);
			font-size: 0.95rem;
		}

		/* Badges */
		.badges {
			display: flex;
			flex-wrap: wrap;
			gap: 0.6rem;
		}

		.badge {
			background: linear-gradient(180deg, #242424 0%, #161616 100%);
			border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
			padding: 0.45rem 1rem;
			border-radius: 20px;
			font-size: 0.85rem;
			color: var(--text-main);
			box-shadow: 
				inset 0 1px 0 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1),
				0 3px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
			transition: all 0.25s ease;
			cursor: default;
		}

		.badge:hover {
			border-color: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.4);
			color: var(--amber);
			transform: translateY(-2px);
			box-shadow: 
				inset 0 1px 0 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2),
				0 6px 12px -2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6),
				0 0 10px -2px var(--amber-glow);
		}

		/* Blog */
		.blog-item {
			margin-bottom: 2rem;
		}

		.blog-item:last-child {
			margin-bottom: 0;
		}

		.blog-item h3 {
			color: var(--text-main);
			margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
			transition: opacity 0.3s ease;
			cursor: pointer;
		}

		.blog-item h3:hover {
			opacity: 0.8;
		}

		.blog-meta {
			color: var(--text-muted);
			font-size: 0.85rem;
			margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
		}

		.blog-item p {
			color: var(--text-muted);
		}

		/* Footer */
		footer {
			margin-top: 4rem;
			padding: 3rem 0;
			border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
			background: var(--bg-black);
		}

		.footer-content {
			display: flex;
			flex-direction: column;
			align-items: center;
			justify-content: center;
			gap: 1.5rem;
			text-align: center;
		}

		.footer-brand {
			font-size: 1.1rem;
			font-weight: 600;
			color: var(--text-main);
			letter-spacing: 0.5px;
		}

		.social-links {
			display: flex;
			gap: 1.25rem;
			align-items: center;
			flex-wrap: wrap;
			justify-content: center;
		}

		.social-icon {
			color: var(--text-muted);
			transition: all 0.3s ease;
			display: flex;
			align-items: center;
			justify-content: center;
		}

		.social-icon svg {
			width: 22px;
			height: 22px;
			fill: currentColor;
		}

		.social-icon:hover {
			color: var(--amber);
			transform: translateY(-2px);
		}

		.footer-copy {
			font-size: 0.85rem;
			color: var(--text-muted);
		}

		/* Back to Top */
		.back-to-top {
			position: fixed;
			bottom: 2rem;
			right: 2rem;
			width: 46px;
			height: 46px;
			background: linear-gradient(180deg, #2a2a2a 0%, #141414 100%);
			border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
			color: var(--amber);
			border-radius: 50%;
			display: flex;
			align-items: center;
			justify-content: center;
			cursor: pointer;
			box-shadow: 
				inset 0 1px 0 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2),
				0 8px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8),
				0 0 15px var(--amber-glow);
			opacity: 0;
			visibility: hidden;
			transform: translateY(10px);
			transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
			z-index: 999;
		}

		.back-to-top.visible {
			opacity: 1;
			visibility: visible;
			transform: translateY(0);
		}

		.back-to-top:hover {
			background: linear-gradient(180deg, #f59e0b 0%, #d97706 100%);
			color: var(--bg-black);
			border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);
			transform: translateY(-3px);
			box-shadow: 
				inset 0 1px 0 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4),
				0 12px 25px -4px rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.8);
		}

		.back-to-top:active {
			transform: translateY(-1px);
			box-shadow: 
				inset 0 2px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4),
				0 4px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
		}

		.back-to-top svg {
			width: 20px;
			height: 20px;
			stroke: currentColor;
			stroke-width: 2.5;
			fill: none;
			stroke-linecap: round;
			stroke-linejoin: round;
		}

		/* Mobile */
		@media (max-width: 768px) {
			section {
				padding: 2.5rem 1.25rem;
				margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
				border-radius: 12px;
			}

			.hero {
				padding-top: 3rem;
				margin-top: 5rem;
			}

			h1 {
				font-size: 2.1rem;
			}

			.subtitle {
				font-size: 1.05rem;
			}

			.stats-grid {
				grid-template-columns: 1fr;
				gap: 1.5rem;
			}

			.stat-number {
				font-size: 2.5rem;
			}

			.back-to-top {
				bottom: 1.5rem;
				right: 1.5rem;
			}
		}
	</style>
</head>
<body>

	<!-- Header -->
	<header id="top">
		<div class="container">
			<div class="header-inner">
				<div class="header-left">
					<div class="dropdown" id="dropdown">
						<button class="dropdown-trigger" id="dropdownTrigger" aria-label="Menüyü Aç" aria-expanded="false">
							<svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
								<line x1="3" y1="6" x2="21" y2="6"></line>
								<line x1="3" y1="12" x2="21" y2="12"></line>
								<line x1="3" y1="18" x2="21" y2="18"></line>
							</svg>
						</button>
						<div class="dropdown-menu" role="menu">
							<a href="#top" class="dropdown-item" role="menuitem">
								<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
									<path d="M3 9l9-7 9 7v11a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z"></path>
									<polyline points="9 22 9 12 15 12 15 22"></polyline>
								</svg>
								<span>Ana Sayfa</span>
							</a>
							<a href="#blog" class="dropdown-item" role="menuitem">
								<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
									<path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"></path>
									<polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"></polyline>
									<line x1="16" y1="13" x2="8" y2="13"></line>
									<line x1="16" y1="17" x2="8" y2="17"></line>
									<line x1="10" y1="9" x2="8" y2="9"></line>
								</svg>
								<span>Blog</span>
							</a>
							<a href="#urunler" class="dropdown-item" role="menuitem">
								<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
									<line x1="16.5" y1="9.4" x2="7.5" y2="4.21"></line>
									<path d="M21 16V8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73l7 4a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 16z"></path>
									<polyline points="3.27 6.96 12 12.01 20.73 6.96"></polyline>
									<line x1="12" y1="22.08" x2="12" y2="12"></line>
								</svg>
								<span>Ürünler</span>
							</a>
							<a href="#hakkimizda" class="dropdown-item" role="menuitem">
								<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
									<path d="M20 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H8a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path>
									<circle cx="12" cy="7" r="4"></circle>
								</svg>
								<span>Hakkımda</span>
							</a>
							<a href="#iletisim" class="dropdown-item" role="menuitem">
								<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
									<path d="M4 4h16c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2v12c0 1.1-.9 2-2 2H4c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V6c0-1.1.9-2 2-2z"></path>
									<polyline points="22,6 12,13 2,6"></polyline>
								</svg>
								<span>İletişim</span>
							</a>
							<a href="#" class="dropdown-item astro-item" role="menuitem">
								<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
									<polygon points="12 2 2 7 12 12 22 7 12 2"></polygon>
									<polyline points="2 12 12 17 22 12"></polyline>
									<polyline points="2 17 12 22 22 17"></polyline>
								</svg>
								<span>Astro Şablonu</span>
							</a>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>

				<a href="#top" class="logo">
					<div class="logo-icon">
						<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 48 48" width="30" height="30">
							<path fill="#e2e8f0" stroke="#0d0d0d" stroke-width="0.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5.63 24l4.696-8.137h9.397L24.42 24l-4.698 8.137h-9.397z" />
							<path fill="#f59e0b" stroke="#0d0d0d" stroke-width="0.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M23.58 13.637L28.274 5.5h9.397l4.698 8.137l-4.698 8.137h-9.397z" />
							<path fill="#f59e0b" stroke="#0d0d0d" stroke-width="0.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M23.58 34.363l4.695-8.137h9.397l4.698 8.137l-4.698 8.137h-9.397z" />
						</svg>
					</div>
					<span>Polinasyon</span>
				</a>

				<div class="header-right">
					<button class="search-btn" id="searchToggle" aria-label="Arama Yap">
						<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"></circle><line x1="21" y1="21" x2="16.65" y2="16.65"></line></svg>
					</button>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div class="search-panel" id="searchPanel">
			<div class="container">
				<div class="search-panel-inner">
					<input type="text" class="search-input" id="searchInput" placeholder="Site içi arama yapın..." aria-label="Arama" />
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</header>

	<div class="container">
		<!-- Hero -->
		<section class="hero">
			<h1>Doğanın Teknolojisi</h1>
			<p class="subtitle">Kanatların Matematiği & Yazılım</p>
			<p class="description">Ben bir doğa araştırmacısı ve web geliştiricisiyim. Ekosistemlerin geleceğini kodluyor, arıların izinde dijital çözümler üretiyorum.</p>
		</section>

		<!-- Ürünler -->
		<section id="urunler">
			<h2>Öne Çıkan Ürünler & Projeler</h2>
			<div class="grid">
				<div class="card">
					<h3>BeeTrack - Kovan Takip</h3>
					<p>Nesnelerin İnterneti (IoT) tabanlı, arı kovanlarının sıcaklık ve nem dengesini anlık izleyen mobil uygulama.</p>
				</div>
				<div class="card">
					<h3>PolenAtlas</h3>
					<p>Yapay zeka algoritmaları kullanarak bitki türlerini ve polen yayılım haritalarını çıkaran web platformu.</p>
				</div>
